   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Try doing something like this:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5427d6f264408abf3049\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5427d6f264408abf3049&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403474769000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1F489tL37Jo6wHSWm8IC66\">https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/5427d6f264408abf3049</a><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">\r\n\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jun 11, 2014 at 12:03 PM, Joon Lim <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jl...@motorola.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Shiny team,<div><br></div><div>How are you? I am using the fluidPage and absolutePanel for my dashboard and also gave id to tabsetPanel and name to each tabPanel. I am trying to find a way to access to <span style=\"line-height:17px\">one of my tabPanels directly from http link? Anyone knows how I can do this?</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Thanks,</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Joon</span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403474769000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22RWDHE-UPMDZo_4-yMSwn\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
